  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Humanitarian Policy Groups Integrated Programme (core activities)  for the period April 2022 - March 2024. Improving humanitarian policy and practice through high quality analysis, dialogue and debate. HPG provides humanitarian actors with analysis and feedback on their work to improve quality and effectiveness. Gender focus is integrated in HPG&#x2019;s work.</narrative>
  </description>
